  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "First public release of Vane.Logging, published as 1.0.0. Public API is backward compatible from this version. Core API carries no Vane prefix; Vane appears as the namespace root only. Microsoft.Extensions.Logging integration ships separately as Vane.Logging.Mel (AddVaneLog / AddVaneLogManager). Analyzer diagnostics cover LLG0001 through LLG0016, including layout pattern validation and expensive interpolation argument warnings. Config keys use the Vane.Logging.* prefix and the Vane.Logging config section. Includes structured output, source generators, buffer writer appenders, cross process shared file writes, and nine appenders. The VanePack binary formatter is an optional experimental extension and is not part of this release. See CHANGELOG.md.",
